2. Or set `mozilla.widget.titlebar-appearance`? Old.
3. Custom: NSMenu can't be hue-tinted; only light/dark/high-contrast.

Also in-app popup menus (XUL panels) get our CSS but native context menus remain system. Native menu theming = dark/light only.

